Lower High\&quot;]\n        I --&gt;|\&quot;Jarak &gt; 0.40% (Zona C / Mid-Zone)\&quot;| J3[\&quot;Ambang Batas &gt;= 65%\\nWajib Selaras Tren Makro H1 &amp; H4\&quot;]\n        I --&gt;|\&quot;AI &gt;= 70% (Sniper Direct)\&quot;| J4[\&quot;Bypass Filter Heuristik (Direct Entry)\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph S6[\&quot;TAHAP 6: HASIL KEPUTUSAN BOT\&quot;]\n        J1 &amp; J2 &amp; J3 &amp; J4 --&gt;|\&quot;Syarat Terpenuhi\&quot;| K1[\&quot;🟢 EKSEKUSI ORDER KE MT5\\n(Open Buy/Sell + SL/TP Otomatis)\&quot;]\n        J1 &amp; J2 &amp; J3 &amp; J4 --&gt;|\&quot;Syarat Tidak Terpenuhi\\n(Misal 58% di Zona C)\&quot;| K2[\&quot;🟡 STANDBY / WAIT\\n(Tertahan Mid-Zone / Filter Menolak)\&quot;]\n    end\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="5NbXWfP2uD_PygwxAkFU-1">
